{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7EXdsxw3zN7N43yT8yU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can draft this. A few answers will make the letter stronger and more specific. Answer whichever you can. If you don't know one, I'll leave it out rather than guess.\n\n1. **Does the college ask referees anything specific?** For example a form, a list of prompts, or a named contact to address it to. If so, please paste it in. Also, what name, farm name, location and contact details should go in the signature?\n\n2. **How did he catch those 9 mastitis cases?** Was it software alerts like conductivity or somatic cell counts, changes in milk yield, or noticing the cows' behavior at milking? And do you know what catching them early saved, such as cows kept in the herd, less milk dumped, or lower treatment costs? Even a rough figure helps.\n\n3. **Should the letter mention the 5-week leave last summer?** The college won't know about it unless you tell them. I'd suggest leaving it out, since it was a family emergency and his record otherwise is 2 missed shifts in 3 years. If you want it in, I'd describe it briefly and fairly.\n\n4. **Should the letter mention his written English?** I'd suggest bringing it up only to say he's taking a night class on his own initiative. That shows he spots his own gaps and works on them. Or would you rather leave it out completely?\n\n5. **Would you hire him back after the program, or give him more responsibility?** Something like \"I would hire him back as herd manager tomorrow\" is often the strongest line in a reference letter. Do you know what he wants to do once he finishes?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":249,"cache_read_input_tokens":9516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":249},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f745608-7b69-45db-b6ac-ed0cda1a153f","uuid":"0b5b2278-2dec-4f7f-9194-0ab2c124b882","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:25:29.683Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7EXdj34Peu2hcToZNG3"}
